      "source": [
        "For this assignment I got my data from [Stathead](https://www.sports-reference.com/stathead/all/). Thinking primarily about the quarterbacks drafted in 2004, I wanted to see what a predictive model would say about their chanches of being Hall of Famers given their distinct resumes. \n",
        "\n",
